codex
The manual clock exposed a teardown dependency in this pressure test: freezing all deadlines also freezes channel disposal for the long-lived command. I’m keeping the pressure admission deterministic via the exact pending-count barrier, while extending only that operation’s exit deadline so the 65th admission check happens before any timeout-driven reset.
